Alembic migrations for Dog Match.

    make migrate                                   # alembic upgrade head
    uv run alembic revision -m "add x"             # hand-written migration
    uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "x"  # needs a running database

The URL comes from DATABASE_URL (see app/db/session.py). For Neon, use the direct
(non-pooled) connection string when running migrations.
